To find Python files that mention "parser", you need to use the filesystem tool to search your project folder for files containing the word "parser". Here's the correct command:

```xml
{"name": "load_tool", "arguments": {"id": "filesystem"}}
{"name": "search_files", "arguments": {"query": "parser"}}
```

This will load the filesystem tool and then search all files in your project folder for those containing "parser".

